wait 0.5
choose stew
tap use
wait 1.2
choose bread
tap use
wait 1.2
tap inventory
wait 0.6
await goal:june 5
await goal_shown 20
shot 14-the-goal-is-june with goal:june,goal_shown
near door:speaker
await door 5
press use
await inside 5
wait 1.0
near dweller
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
await met:june 2
await beat:june_met 2
wait 0.4
shot 15-june-at-her-table with talking,met:june
press use
