wait 0.4
shot 16-she-always-knew with talking,beat:june_knew
press pause
wait 0.5
near door
wait 0.3
press use 0.1
await outside 5
wait 0.6

# --- 7 THE AFTERNOON: what she always knew, felt; back to her ----------------------------------
hour 14
wait 1.0
await goal:june_voice 5
await goal_shown 20
shot 17-the-goal-is-back-to-her with goal:june_voice,goal_shown
near door:speaker
await door 5
press use
await inside 5
wait 1.0
near dweller
wait 0.4
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:echo_kept 3
wait 0.4
shot 18-where-not-to-be with talking,beat:echo_kept
press pause
wait 0.5
near door
wait 0.3
press use 0.1
await outside 5
wait 0.6

# --- 8 MENDED GEAR, while it settles: what the Covenant lives on, for the plate he has spent ---
# The warden waits on what the voice kept her from, and home waits on the warden,
# so the goal is the mend. The Covenant's square has a bench by its fire; the mend
# is an hour's work left going at it (Crafting.sets_going).
await goal:mend 5
await goal_shown 20
shot 19-the-goal-is-the-mended-plate with goal:mend,goal_shown
at stood:the_covenant
await stood:the_covenant 5
near bench
wait 0.6
tap craft
await app:crafting 3
choose plate_mended
tap use
wait 0.4
tap craft
await app:none 3
await made:plate_mended 90
wait 0.6
shot 20-the-plate-mended-at-the-covenants-bench with station:bench
# Mended, and still settling: the relay below, still not home.
await goal:relay 5

# --- 9 THE WARDEN: once what the voice kept her from has settled, the Covenant's warden ---
hour 19
wait 1.0
tap lamp
wait 0.4
await goal:warden 5
await goal_shown 20
shot 21-the-goal-is-solis with goal:warden,goal_shown
at cast:solis
await cast:solis 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:teague_sold 3
wait 0.4
shot 22-solis-says-whose-roads with talking,beat:teague_sold
# Every road but one.
press use
await beat:walker_told 3
wait 0.4
shot 23-every-road-but-up with talking,beat:walker_told
press use
wait 0.6
# The lamp out for the night, or its one flask burns through it.
tap lamp
await unlit 2

# --- 10 THE ROAD UP: the next morning, the lame walker, from the crater its foot comes back to --
hour 9 +1
wait 1.0
tap inventory
wait 0.5
choose stew
tap use
wait 1.2
choose bread
tap use
wait 1.2
tap inventory
wait 0.6
await goal:walker 5
await goal_shown 20
shot 24-the-goal-is-the-lame-walker with goal:walker,goal_shown
press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.6
shot 25-the-survey-marks-the-crater with app:map,goal:walker
press map 0.2
await app:none 5
# At the crater, and on to when the foot comes back to it, that afternoon.
place tread0
wait 0.5
hour tread0+5
await colossus_tread 30
at climb:lip
walkto at:climb:cable 60 till:climb_cable
await climb_cable 5
wait 2
shot 26-at-the-cable with colossus_tread,climb_cable,goal:walker
tap use
await climbing 3
await climb_patch 10
wait 1
shot 27-on-the-cable with climbing,climb_patch
# The cable, ledge by ledge (eighteen of them), until its top hands him on to
# the drum; then each pitch to the top that lifts him into the bone. The world
# runs at the climb's set-piece share while he is up (43_climb).
climb onto 900
climb rode 600
until climb_ready 240
climb rode 600
until climb_ready 240
shot 28-on-the-thigh with climbing,climb_patch
# Dusk on the thigh, and the crown is reached after dark: lit up here, at a
# pitch's top. On the leg his hands are the climb's, but the lamp's key is still
# his (Game.keys_held).
tap lamp
await lamp 2
climb rode 900
until climb_ready 240
climb rode 600
until climb_ready 240
shot 29-under-the-hubs-rim with climbing,climb_patch,lamp
climb at_hub 600
await talking 5
wait 1
shot 30-the-panel-in-the-crown with talking
tap use
await beat:enclave_met 5
wait 1
shot 31-it-counts-him with talking,beat:enclave_met
tap use
await climb:down 10
wait 2
# Supper on coming down, nothing eaten since the morning, and another meal in
# the morning (no meal is eaten ahead).
tap inventory
wait 0.5
choose stew
tap use
wait 1.2
choose bread
tap use
wait 1.2
tap inventory
wait 0.6

